VALUES (8216, 'tt0097858', NULL, 'Meet the Feebles', 'Meet the Feebles', 'movie', 1989, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/31DqGazwdE9N4Y9FHC6Q4NvstuW.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fji432Vjgj89p0ISOJONYyfNUmy.jpg', 'Heidi the Hippo, star of ''The Feebles Variety Hour'', discovers her lover Bletch the Walrus is cheating on her. And with all the world waiting for the big show, the assorted co-stars must contend with drug addiction, extortion, robbery, disease, Vietnam flashbacks, drug dealing, and murder.', NULL, NULL, 2.1427, 6.3, 0, 12.578, '2026-08-03 14:31:56', '2026-11-26 02:07:22')
