VALUES (8923, 'tt0385002', NULL, 'Green Street Hooligans', 'Green Street Hooligans', 'movie', 2005, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oTxHFRSbFcCWdfJB4ozA41Yq57c.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/isRzCN0ATsZ4CdBf6CSGA2ruclW.jpg', 'After being wrongfully expelled from Harvard University, American Matt Buckner flees to his sister''s home in England. Once there, he is befriended by her charming and dangerous brother-in-law, Pete Dunham, and introduced to the underworld of British football hooliganism. Matt learns to stand his ground through a friendship that develops against the backdrop of this secret and often violent world. ''Green Street Hooligans'' is a story of loyalty, trust and the sometimes brutal consequences of living close to the edge.', NULL, NULL, 4.6752, 7.283, 0, 1.05428571428571427e+01, '2026-08-19 01:49:52', '2026-11-26 02:07:22')
