VALUES (157409, 'tt2332579', NULL, 'Crystal Fairy & the Magical Cactus', 'Crystal Fairy y el cactus mágico', 'movie', 2013, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jX34ccG13P66S4qVqLRRyR0hZLS.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/peH8u8aGZlvMXQXI7HwzE2F76Sj.jpg', 'Jamie is a boorish, insensitive American twentysomething traveling in Chile, who somehow manages to create chaos at every turn. He and his friends are planning on taking a road trip north to experience a legendary shamanistic hallucinogen called the San Pedro cactus. In a fit of drunkenness at a wild party, Jamie invites an eccentric woman—a radical spirit named Crystal Fairy—to come along.', NULL, NULL, 1.4599, 5.9, 0, 3.01333333333333319e+00, '2026-08-21 01:43:43', '2026-11-26 02:07:22')
